# A believer in the golden ticket. Tell her the truth or let her keep hoping.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('maren_told')
goto: Told

cond: HasFlag('maren_hoping')
goto: Hoping

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Are you here for the draw too? Nine days now. They'll call my number. I sold the flat for this slip.
#
o_text: The ships leave with cargo. There are no berths.
o_id: maren_truth
o_cond: HasFlag('wen_slipped') || HasFlag('QuestCompleted(dead_freight, public)') || HasFlag('QuestCompleted(recluse, allied)')
o_goto: Truth
#
o_text: Good luck. I hope they call it.
o_id: maren_hope
o_goto: Hope
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: maren_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Truth
npc: (She looks at the slip for a long time.) ... I knew. I think I knew. Terra Vitae takes people in, don't they? Father Olaf. I'll go there. (She tears the slip in half and walks.)
effect: SetFlag('maren_told')
effect: EndConversation

name: Hope
npc: Thank you. You're the first person who said that like they meant it.
effect: SetFlag('maren_hoping')
effect: EndConversation

name: Told
npc: (She's packing.) Terra Vitae. Thank you, I think.
effect: EndConversation

name: Hoping
npc: Any day now. Any day.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Ten days tomorrow.
effect: EndConversation
